WEBVTT

00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:30.476
Payshanba kuni, giyohvandlik haqida

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:33.929
va juma kuni esa, xavfli jinsiy aloqa
va baxt o’rasidagi tanlov”.

00:08:33.953 --> 00:08:34.976
(Kulgi)

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:37.143
Men: “Jumada bunday
tanlovni hamma qiladi”.

00:08:37.167 --> 00:08:39.976
(Kulgi)

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:42.976
(Qarsaklar)

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:45.858
Sizga yoqqanidan hursandman,
lekin ular bunga hafa bo’lishdi.

00:08:45.882 --> 00:08:46.976
Jimjitlik bo’lib qoldi.

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:50.276
Men ular: “Men sizning
maktabingizda suhbat bilan chiqishga

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:52.976
tayyorman, lekin sizda sog’lomlik
haftasi o’rniga,

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:55.676
kasallik haftasi bo’lib qolyapti.
Yaxshi narsalar

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:57.376
haqida aytish ham kerak" - dedim.

00:08:57.400 --> 00:08:59.176
Yo'q kasallik – bu sog’lomlik emas.

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:00.576
Sog’lom bo’lish uchun –